Problem Statement
Eightfold processes millions of job postings daily. We need an AI-powered Job Recommendation Engine that matches candidates to relevant jobs.
Build a backend service that:

Allows adding candidate profiles with their skills, experience level, and preferred roles
Allows adding job postings with required skills, experience level, and role type
When a candidate requests recommendations, use AI to score and rank the top 5 matching jobs for them
Each recommendation should include a match score and a reason why the job fits
Cache the recommendations so the same candidate isn't scored twice unnecessarily
Track how many times each candidate has requested recommendations


